Two small counterexamples did reproduce: the search ignores a profitable pair move when both singleton moves lose, and the degeneracy report misclassifies rows when two seeds reuse an anchor ID. Its reporting arithmetic works for unique IDs, but its caller currently supplies a baseline certificate that does not establish the required physical fixed point.

