All 24 learned heads passed the in-memory update check: each head’s parameters changed and each Adam step counter reached two. I found no head removal or untrained neutral head.

The remaining blockers are in integration: rule-specific planning, source/evaluation snapshot matching, the certified reference, and the missing driver for the declared schedule. The existing smoke also commits identical configurations for all four C3 counterpart pairs under both rules; that confirms the smoke has no C3 separation, but does not establish what would happen at epoch 9,000.

